    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This media characteristic is present when the [`CMVideoFormatDescription`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMVideoFormatDescription) includes a [`kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_HorizontalFieldOfView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_HorizontalFieldOfView) extension.",
      "ko": "이 미디어 특성은 [`CMVideoFormatDescription`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMVideoFormatDescription)에 [`kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_HorizontalFieldOfView`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/kCMFormatDescriptionExtension_HorizontalFieldOfView) 확장자가 포함된 경우에 나타납니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e7b3cc9daf3be2ff23b8c98c35ad3a2ac3ffd61e6c01ef7d2a15b267ef63f60d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "This is not an indication that the field of view is expanded beyond or more narrow than typical horizontal fields of view.",
      "ko": "이는 시야각이 일반적인 수평 시야각보다 넓어지거나 더 좁아졌다는 뜻이 아닙니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2e4cc6ea2364452e69ba0e49df49ac28e811f24c733a135288782dc2581d8e4c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The value of this characteristic is `public.indicates-horizontal-field-of-view`.",
      "ko": "이 특성의 값은 `public.indicates-horizontal-field-of-view`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2b418c64214446f005a57dcc7413a702bd7b8230cc7d4ee4c4a7c4daa5c61d08",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: The presence of this characteristic is strictly inferred from the format description of the associated track.",
      "ko": "**Note**: 이 특성의 존재는 연관된 트랙의 형식 설명에서 엄격하게 유추됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d8d89bcf41a3f0ab25cf0309beb3107781ad79ae268f9315d8fa15ed00a89e1c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
